{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00412","headline":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 太和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 明皇祀圜丘乐章 太和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六成既阕，三荐云终。\n神心具醉，圣敬愈崇。\n受厘皇邸，回跸帷宫。\n穰穰之福，永永无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}